    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Group Out</strong> is a casual top-down extraction shooter set in a collapsed society where only survival matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by &quot;Escape from Tarkov&quot; and &quot;The Escapists&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scavenge &amp; Survive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a hostile, abandoned land teeming with danger and opportunity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab what you can before time runs out, or risk losing it all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your loot runs to level up, grow your wealth, and prepare for greater threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Loot, Sell, Upgrade</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find gear, weapons, and oddities scattered across the wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell what you don\u2019t need to buy stronger equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize and enhance your weapons with powerful buffs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/07b00fcfd1d1f5e973dc5f992daad6c4.poster.avif?t=1753379137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/07b00fcfd1d1f5e973dc5f992daad6c4.webm?t=1753379137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/07b00fcfd1d1f5e973dc5f992daad6c4.mp4?t=1753379137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up &amp; Evolve</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain XP by defeating enemies, looting gear, and completing quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons, equipment, and boss challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your loadout to match your playstyle: stealthy, aggressive, or something in between. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/09254f8d58ab12b96c98b5683c905eda.poster.avif?t=1753379137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/09254f8d58ab12b96c98b5683c905eda.webm?t=1753379137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/09254f8d58ab12b96c98b5683c905eda.mp4?t=1753379137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use All Your Senses</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Danger lurks in every shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop. Look. Listen. Smell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your instincts and stealth to stay one step ahead of enemies and rivals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solo or Co-op</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go it alone, or team up with up to 3 friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on missions, level up, and extract with hard-earned loot, together.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Group Out</strong> is a casual top-down extraction shooter set in a collapsed society where only survival matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by &quot;Escape from Tarkov&quot; and &quot;The Escapists&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scavenge &amp; Survive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a hostile, abandoned land teeming with danger and opportunity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab what you can before time runs out, or risk losing it all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your loot runs to level up, grow your wealth, and prepare for greater threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Loot, Sell, Upgrade</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find gear, weapons, and oddities scattered across the wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell what you don\u2019t need to buy stronger equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize and enhance your weapons with powerful buffs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/07b00fcfd1d1f5e973dc5f992daad6c4.poster.avif?t=1753379137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/07b00fcfd1d1f5e973dc5f992daad6c4.webm?t=1753379137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/07b00fcfd1d1f5e973dc5f992daad6c4.mp4?t=1753379137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up &amp; Evolve</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain XP by defeating enemies, looting gear, and completing quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons, equipment, and boss challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your loadout to match your playstyle: stealthy, aggressive, or something in between. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/09254f8d58ab12b96c98b5683c905eda.poster.avif?t=1753379137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/09254f8d58ab12b96c98b5683c905eda.webm?t=1753379137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843730/extras/09254f8d58ab12b96c98b5683c905eda.mp4?t=1753379137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use All Your Senses</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Danger lurks in every shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop. Look. Listen. Smell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your instincts and stealth to stay one step ahead of enemies and rivals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solo or Co-op</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go it alone, or team up with up to 3 friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on missions, level up, and extract with hard-earned loot, together.</p></li></ul>",
